WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for emotional-hook.mp4 generated from the transcript. Retime them to the final edit.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
[Solo piano, slow and sparse. Distant wind.]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Nobody sees the five a.m. alarms.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Nobody sees the rain. The doubt. The voice that says quit.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
[Music stops. A single heartbeat, then another.]

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
They only see what you do next.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Vimbright Rise. Fuel for the comeback.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
[Full orchestra and drums swell. The crowd roars.]

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Rise again.
